<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mobedan mobed</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The mobedan mobed, 'priest of priests', was the chief Zoroastrian priest of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a>. He headed the religious hierarchy and had important judicial and advisory functions. The office reflected the close alliance between Zoroastrian clergy and the Sasanian monarchy.</p></div>
